# The site is a static export in public/. Hide everything else from Vercel so

# it does NOT auto-detect a Python app (which causes "No python entrypoint

# found"). These files remain in the GitHub repo for the build/CI workflow;

# .vercelignore only affects what is uploaded to Vercel.

src/
scripts/
tests/
config/
data/
models_store/
reports/
.github/
.venv/
requirements.txt
_.py
_.pyc
**pycache**/
.pytest_cache/
README.md
